<chapter num="32">
    <title>Solo Leveling</title>
    <author>Chugong</author>
    <illustrator>Jang Sung-Rak</illustrator>
    <body>
        <page pageNum="1">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="1" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="1"/> BY THEIR REACTIONS... YOU'VE BEEN REAWAKENED RECENTLY,
                HUH. </bubble>
            <caption type="thought" thtNum="1" who="Gang Tae-Shik">THINKING ABOUT IT, RECENTLY MY
                BOSS DID GO TO SEE SOMEONE BECAUSE HE THOUGHT THEY REAWAKENED...</caption>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="2" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/>ANYWAYS, IT SEEMS LIKE YOU HAVE LITTLE EXPERIENCE IN BEING A
                HUNTER. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="3" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> IN THAT CASE... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="4" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> LET ME TEACH YOU A LESSON AS YOUR SUPERIOR </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="5" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="2"/> TELL ME, WHY DID YOU DO THIS? </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="2">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="6" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHAT, THIS? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="7" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> KILLING THE PRISONERS? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="8" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I MEAN EVERYTHING. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="9" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> HOH~ </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="10" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> THAT'S A PRETTY DAMN SCARRY FACE YOU GOT THERE! </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="3">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="11" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> LIGHTEN UP, IT'S NOT LIKE I'M DOING THIS FOR FUN. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="12" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="3"/> I HEARD THAT EVERYTHING THAT HAPPENS IN A DUNGEON STAYS
                IN A DUNGEON. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="13" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> THIS IS 2 BILLION WON. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="4">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="14" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> I THINK YOU CAN UNDERSTAND WHAT I'M TRYING TO SAY.. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="15" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> PLEASE, HUNTER, I BEG YOU... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="16" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> PLEASE... KILL THOSE BASTARDS...! </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="17" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> IN ADDITION TO THIS MONEY, 1 BILLION MORE TO TAKE CARE OF THE
                OTHER HUNTERS. IS THAT POSSIBLE FOR YOU? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="18" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> BUT WHY ARE YOU DING THIS? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="19" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHEN YOU FIND A PIECE OF TRASH IN THE STREETS, YOU FEEL
                UNCOMFORTABLE, </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="20" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> BUT YOU DON'T PICK IT UP. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="5">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="21" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHY PICK THEM UP AND THROW THEM IN THE TRASH, THEN? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="22" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> ONE OF THE PRISONERS YOU ARE RESPONSIBLE FOR TRAUMATIZED MY
                DAUGHTER. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="23" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> BECASUE OF THE, SHE HUNG HERSELF, </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="24" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> AND HER MOTHER IS STILL IN THE HOSPITAL FROM THE SHOCK. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="25" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> THINKING ABOUT HOW THAT ANIMAL WILL FREELY ROAM THE STREETS AFTER
                A FEW YEARS DESPITE WHAT HE'S DONE... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="26" who="Grieving Father">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT DOESN'T LET ME SLEEP AT NIGHT. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="27" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> I UNDERSTAND. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="28" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> I WILL PROVIDE AN ADAQUATE SERVICE WORTHY OF 3 BILLION WON, SO
                DON'T WORRY. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="29" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> I CAN'T JUST REFUSE A FATHER WHO'S DAUGHTER WAS MANHANDELED BY
                THESE CRIMINALS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="30" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> I TRIED TO REFUSE BY RAISING THE PRICE, BUT HE ACCEPTED IT RIGHT
                AWAY. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="6">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="31" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> ALTHOUGH THINGS HAVE BECOME LIKE THIS, I DON'T WANT TO HURT YOU
                GUYS. IF YOU PROMISE TO NOT SPEAK OF TODAY'S INCIDENT, I WILL LET YOU ALL GO. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="32" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> DUNNO... YOU MAY SAY THAT, BUT YOUR EXPRESSION TELLS ME THAT YOU
                WANT TO TEACH US A LESSON AND SHOW US WHO'S SUPERIOR, NO? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="33" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I HAD NO INTENTION OF BELIEVING OF YOUR WORDS IN THE FIRST PLACE. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="34" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THERE'S NO REASON TO BELIEVE SOMEONE WHO WAS CREATING RANDOM
                STORIES ABOUT DEATHS MOMENTS AGO. </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="7">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="35" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> HEH, IT DOESN'T MATTER IF YOU BELIEVE ME OR NOT.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="36" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT'S JUST PITIFUL THAT ALL OF YOU WILL DIE ALONGSIDE THOSE INSECTS.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="37" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THEN YOU'RE DAMN PITIFUL AS WELL.
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="8">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="38" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHAT? 
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="39" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> BECAUSE YOU WILL DIE SOON.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="40" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> I DON'T KNOW HOW MANY RANKS YOU ROSE SINCE E-RANK, BUT IT WON'T BE AS EASY AS YOU THINK!
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="9">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="41" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> SLOW.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="42" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> PRETTY FAST...
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="10">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="43" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="4"/> HOW CAN THEY MOVE LIKE THIS...!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="44" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> HE REALLY IS NO LONGER THE MR. SUNG I KNOW...
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="45" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> HEY, HEY, 3 BILLION WON IS TOO LITTLE FOR THIS JOB NOW!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="46" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHO WOULD'VE THOUGHT I'D MEET A HUNTER AT THIS LEVEL HERE!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="2" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> OUR SPEED'S ARE THE SAME!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="3" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> OUR SPEED'S ARE THE SAME!
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="11">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="47" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> IS THIS YOUR FASTEST SPEED?!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="48" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> EVEN IF YOUR EYES CAN CATCH UP, IF YOUR BODY CAN'T, THEN IT'S USELESS!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="49" who="Lee Joo-Hee">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="5"/> JIN-WOO!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="50" who="Lee Joo-Hee">
                <unique ans="n"/> STAY STRONG!!
            </bubble>
            <caption type="thought" thtNum="4" who="Gang Tae-Shik">HASTE AND BURN BOOSTER.</caption>
            <caption type="thought" thtNum="5" who="Gang Tae-Shik">I CAN'T PLAY AROUND ANYMORE.</caption>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="12"/>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="13">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="6" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> EVEN IF WE HAVE SIMILAR SPECS AND SKILLS, OUR DIFFERENCE IN EXPERIENCE IS TOO VAST.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="7" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> AND THAT DIFFERENCE WILL LEAD TO YOUR DEFEAT.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="51" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF YOU'RE GONNA PROTECT YOUR HEALER, THEN DO IT RIGHT.
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="14">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="52" who="Lee Joo-Hee">
                <unique ans="n"/> JIN-WOO!!
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="15">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="53" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> HOH~ YOU'RE PRETTY DURABLE, EH?
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="54" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> SORRY, BUT CAN YOU LOWER YOUR KILLING INTENT PLEASE?
            </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>[AN EMERGENCY QUEST HAS ACTIVATED.]</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="55" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT'S SENSITIVE TO KILLING INTENT.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="56" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THE SYSTEM ACTIVATED ON IT'S OWN AGAIN.
            </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>QUEST DIRECTIONS</info>
                <info>[EMERGENCY QUEST: EXTERMINATION]</info>
                <info>THERE ARE 'PLAYERS' WHO HAVE KILLING INTENT TOWARDS YOU IN CLOSE PROXIMITY.</info>
                <info>SLAY THEM AND ENSURE YOUR SAFETY.</info>
                <info>IF THIS QUEST IS NOT COMPLETED, YOUR HEART WILL STOP.</info>
                <info>NUMBER OF PALYERS TO KILL: 1</info>
                <info>NUMBER OF PLAYERS KILLED: 0</info>
            </systemMsg>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="16">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="57" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I'M COMING.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="8" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> I'M HOLDING THE ADVANTAGE...
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="9" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHAT IS HE THINKING?
            </bubble>
        </page>
    </body>
</chapter>
